 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-11","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.57","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.57/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"b0dc3cf3b9ec0b0f60f5f9585b2d06e5363574b0b2e5b8e6c3f2e706bac5a912"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.57/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"de43a041f6d47801197bc297799c6874264e7ef197a452de64b4932d3e4bc46e"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.57/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"312079a1e1c0f506a74fd5c736c63a1862073e203ff7d31a884a23835d4c9bfa"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.57/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"f050022e1f0d646c49aeefc0512b7b61a66595878b796beea75e5bd464936ec9"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.57"}